nes und desselben durch drei oder mehr Śloka.\n — p〉 *abschüssige Lage, Neigung, proclivitas; Vgl. 1〉b〉.\n — q〉 in der Astrol. = प्लवत्व SĀRĀV. bei UTPALA zu VARĀH. BṚH. 1,20.\n — r〉 ein best. Metrum.\n — s〉 Name eines Sāman. Auch वसिष्ठस्य प्लवः ĀRṢ. BR.\n — t〉 das Springen, Sprung.\n — u〉 *Zurückkunft.\n — v〉 *das Antreiben.\n— 4〉 n. eine best. Pflanze. Nach den Lexicographen Cyperus rotundus und wohlriechendes Gras. MBH. 7,1121. पटिशायोधनप्लवैः fehlerhaft für ˚योधनोपलैः oder ˚योघनोपलैः, wie die anderen Ausgaben haben.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["प्लवं", "प्लवः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["plavaM", "plavaH"]}, {"id": "plAva", "headword": "प्लाव", "headword_slp1": "plAva", "fold": "plava", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "प्लाव m.\n— 1〉 das Ueberfliessen, Abfliessen. प्लावा f. MĀRK. P. 35,18 fehlerhaft.\n— 2〉 das Springen.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["प्लावः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["plAvaH"]}], "plavaka": [{"id": "plavaka", "headword": "प्लवक", "headword_slp1": "plavaka", "fold": "plavaka", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "प्लवक m.\n— 1〉 ein Springer von Profession MBH. 13,23,15.\n— 2〉 *Frosch.\n— 3〉 *ein Caṇḍāla.\n— 4〉 *Ficus infectoria RĀJAN. 11,126.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["प्लवकः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["plavakaH"]}, {"id": "plavAkA", "headword": "प्लवाका", "headword_slp1": "plavAkA", "fold": "plavaka", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "*प्लवाका f. Boot, Nachen.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "plavaga": [{"id": "plavaga", "headword": "प्लवग", "headword_slp1": "plavaga", "fold": "plavaga", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "— 1〉 Adj. = प्लव 1〉d〉 SĀRĀV. bei UTPALA zu VARĀH. BṚH. 1,20.\n— 2〉 m.\n — a〉 Frosch.\n — b〉 Affe.\n — c